<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese bomber flew near the Philippine coast and a Chinese plane was confirmed in the West Philippine Sea. The Armed Forces monitored 48 Chinese Coast Guard and People’s Liberation Army Navy vessels across four key features from November 17 to 23, more than double the previous count. The Philippine Coast Guard added three locally built survey ships and three new vessels, BRP Patag, BRP Pag-asa and BRP Kalikasan, joining US patrol boats. Joint naval exercises with France were held in the Sulu Sea and a partnership with Japan provided five new Coast Guard vessels. 176 battle-related deaths were reported in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Manila Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOZUhKRkFzRjN2d1RMN3RpUng5Z24ySDB0UC1CcHRnRDlta0Z6ZDdaSHQxWDhPVGx5THpmb1lWem9GbHlyUWxrWXJ1cWFUcWhveTlOTVFCZWswZFhzRm1zcURlRUpaSnZIYmJnSUxScUs4QThxT2I2bjREWUNZU0JFMFRfcWl2c0pWeXN0N2pIWGtmV21OQUhsamVEYXhhUXhNQkpQTjdpa0xmZmJhMUNn?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Mindanao Sentinel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQa210ekw2a3g3djVNREJjdHQwVzUxZ2YyTnRQMk8ybk81UHpscWtkWll0VzVxNGdobE82SWktRzNCdk5VYTVReHdZcW1KbkNzekFpWDFMNUxFUk1LV1BlR01vWjc3RGxlWkpNMUtvenoycnVTX0QtV1o1REZ6bmxGdllEa1FWejhLN1Z0VEdNOW53aEFjdHNWSnV2Zm5LR196S2J5RUR0a2paTEVDbl8xZ2xqSXJJZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Manila Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95